{"result":["DdK1Ocuw"],"entities":{"projects":[{"uid":"DdK1Ocuw","title":"VoxBento: Real-Time Speech Translation and Multilingual Interpretation","body":"VoxBento is a real-time, browser-first interpretation platform that combines speech processing, NLP, and generative AI to make live events accessible across languages. It uses a low-latency WebRTC pipeline built with FastAPI and MediaMTX, enabling real-time audio streaming directly from the browser.\n\nAt the core is an extensible AI pipeline for real-time speech-to-text, multilingual machine translation, and live captioning. Audio is processed using a hybrid architecture of local and cloud-based models, including faster-whisper, Deepgram, and OpenAI, with LLMs such as Groq, Anthropic, and Gemini powering real-time translation workflows. Asynchronous processing and WebSocket-based coordination allow these NLP workloads to operate continuously without blocking the critical media path.\n\nThe project focuses on building low-latency, scalable NLP pipelines for live speech, combining speech recognition, language understanding, machine translation, and distributed inference into a unified multilingual accessibility platform.","size":"large","tech_tags":["python","postgresql","javascript","django","docker","ffmpeg","webrtc","nlp","HLS","Nginx","TTS","STT","Jitsi Meet"],"topic_tags":["web","streaming","accessibility","nlp","Localization","TTS","STT","Real‑Time Communication","Audio/Video","Cloud / DevOps","Conferences / Events"],"status":"active","phase":"work_period_2","date_created":"2026-04-29T00:04:13.092753Z","date_updated":"2026-08-23T06:22:57.388369Z","assigned_mentors":["Soong Chee Gi","Nils Magnus"],"project_length":22,"github_username":"ArnavBallinCode","github_url":"https://github.com/ArnavBallinCode","contributor_name":"Arnav Angarkar","body_short":"VoxBento is a real-time, browser-first interpretation platform that combines speech processing, NLP, and generative AI to make live events accessible...","proposal